#. ja: 「<sheet InstanceContent $n1 3>」を<br>「<switch $n4><case>通常ロット<case>GREED限定<case>マスタールート</switch>」で開始しようとしています。<br>         <br>このコンテンツは、パーティーリーダーが、<br>あなたの進行度よりも手前の状態のため、<br>そこまでの過程をやり直す必要があります。<br><br>開始してもよろしいですか？
#. de: Achtung, der Gruppenanführer ist in diesem Inhalt noch nicht so weit fortgeschritten wie du. Du wirst zu seiner Position zurück versetzt.<br><br><sheet InstanceContent $n1 3> (Beuteregel: <switch $n4><case>Standard<case>Nur Gier<case>Anführer</switch>) trotzdem betreten?
#. fr: Attention<nbsp>: vous allez commencer “<sheet InstanceContent $n1 3>” avec la règle du butin “<switch $n4><case>normale<case>juste cupidité<case>maître du butin</switch>”.<br>Cette mission étant moins avancée que votre progression actuelle, vous devrez refaire les étapes intermédiaires.<br><br>Confirmer<nbsp>?
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet InstanceContent $n1 3> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = InstanceContent, row = number parameter 1, column = 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <switch $n4><case>Normal<case>Greed Only<case>Lootmaster</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 4 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Addon:8093:0:0"
msgid "Caution. You have already completed the duty selected.<br><br>Enter <sheet InstanceContent $n1 3>?<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Loot rule: <switch $n4><case>Normal<case>Greed Only<case>Lootmaster</switch></ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Вы уже проходили это испытание.<br><br>Войти в «<sheet InstanceContent $n1 3>»?<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※Добыча: <switch $n4><case>Обычный розыгрыш<case>Только жадность<case>Главный по добыче</switch></ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 「<sheet InstanceContent $n1 3>」を<br>「<switch $n4><case>通常ロット<case>GREED限定<case>マスタールート</switch>」で開始しようとしています。<br>         <br>このコンテンツは、パーティーリーダーが、<br>あなたの進行度よりも手前の状態のため、<br>そこまでの過程をやり直す必要があります。<br><br>また、「<sheet InstanceContent $n1 3>」を<br>攻略済みのメンバーが<num $n2>名存在するため、<br>宝箱の出現数は「<num $n3>個」となります。<br><br>開始してもよろしいですか？
#. de: Achtung, der Gruppenanführer ist in diesem Inhalt noch nicht so weit fortgeschritten wie du. Du wirst zu seiner Position zurück versetzt.<br>Außerdem <if ($n2 == 1)>hat ein Grup<shy>pen<shy>mit<shy>glied<else>haben <num $n2> Grup<shy>pen<shy>mit<shy>glieder</if> den Inhalt bereits abgeschlossen, daher <if ($n3 == 1)>wird nur eine Schatztruhe<else>werden <num $n3> Schatztruhen</if> erscheinen.<br><br><sheet InstanceContent $n1 3> (Beuteregel: <switch $n4><case>Standard<case>Nur Gier<case>Anführer</switch>) trotzdem betreten?
#. fr: Attention<nbsp>: vous allez commencer “<sheet InstanceContent $n1 3>” avec la règle du butin “<switch $n4><case>normale<case>juste cupidité<case>maître du butin</switch>”.<br>Cette mission étant moins avancée que votre progression actuelle, vous devrez refaire les étapes intermédiaires.<br><br>Par ailleurs, <num $n2> membre<if ($n2 <= 1)><else>s</if> ayant déjà terminé “<sheet InstanceContent $n1 3>”, seul<if ($n3 <= 1)><else>s</if> <num $n3> coffre<if ($n3 <= 1)><else>s</if> apparaîtr<if ($n3 <= 1)>a<else>ont</if> en cas de victoire.<br><br>Confirmer<nbsp>?
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <capitalize><if $n2><if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><els… — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if $n2><if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n2><… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n2></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 <= 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($n2 == 1)>member of the party has<else>members of the party have</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <capitalize><if $n3><if ($n3 <= 10)><switch $n3><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><els… — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if $n3><if ($n3 <= 10)><switch $n3><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n3><… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 3 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n3 <= 10)><switch $n3><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n3></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 3 <= 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n3><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 3 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n3> — a number; value = number parameter 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
